# Footage is a moment; the manifest is the durable thing. Same rule as harness/.gitignore —
# a 40-second ProRes take is 400MB that git must never see.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*/.gitkeep

# But a transcript is text, and it is the thing the script is written FROM. 03-john/.gitkeep
# has named `interview__transcript` as an expected artifact since the folder was made; without
# this line the transcript of a 79-minute interview that cannot be recorded twice was ignored
# alongside the 3.6 GB it came out of.
!*/*.md
